     1296   field vat-rubl-buyer-doc    as decimal
     1297   field slt-base-doc          as decimal
     1298   field slt-rubl-doc          as decimal
     1299   field road-tax-base-doc     as decimal
     1300   field road-tax-rubl-doc     as decimal
     1301   field excise-base-doc       as decimal
